    <string name="prepare_instructions_noteOffline">If you lose connection, you can keep working. Answers stay saved on this device and sync when reconnected while the clock keeps running.</string>
    <string name="prepare_instructions_noteSingleDevice">Each attempt runs on one device at a time. Opening it on another device requires confirming takeover.</string>

